{"unit_id":"menghuanshiguang__dsh-sunder#card-card-zh","repo":"menghuanshiguang/dsh-sunder","commit":"02f39abe27211dec8fd731fc89cd433ab6f61033","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-sunder 是面向 DSH Web 客户端的提示词 bundle，可用中英文和 full、concise、dev 预设替换默认身份与规则。它注册身份、规则和页脚三段提示词，并在每轮首个请求追加规则卡；同时提供提示词预览、状态、公告确认和更新工具。插件可显示远端公告与版本更新，并在 Web 设置页呈现配置卡片和未读公告横幅。适合希望调整 DSH 对话风格、查看公告或管理插件更新的用户；公告与更新检查默认启用，状态保存在 DSH 数据目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:313-356","index.js:776-846","lib/client.js:1379-1384","lib/state.js:22-25"]}
{"unit_id":"menghuanshiguang__dsh-sunder#card-card-en","repo":"menghuanshiguang/dsh-sunder","commit":"02f39abe27211dec8fd731fc89cd433ab6f61033","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-sunder adds prompt presets to DSH Web and a rule card on each turn’s first request. Session tools preview prompts, report status, manage announcements, and update releases. A browser panel shows details and unread notices; local state records acknowledgements and update checks.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:313-356","index.js:776-846","lib/client.js:1379-1384","lib/state.js:22-25"]}
